btain the following curve:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13949104/assets/1aa848f287660c0858d5d6478da71c5baab9252c13f0a2d4a48c38d61f6bce51.png)"}]}
